OL,3,GNEWSASailing gives visually impaired
OL,4,Achild 'another sense of life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Tadiwa was just one years old, he
OL,7,Fwas diagnosed with a brain tumour.
OL,9,FHis mother, Vennisa, had noticed he was
OL,10,Flosing weight, and after he was
OL,11,Feventually sent for an MRI scan,
OL,12,Fdoctors discovered he had Optic Pathway
OL,13,FGlioma, which cannot be removed.
OL,15,FSince then, the 12-year-old from
OL,16,FWellingborough, Northamptonshire, has
OL,17,Fundergone countless hospital
OL,18,Fappointments, chemotherapy and proton
OL,19,Fbeam therapy, which he says led to
OL,20,Fmissing "so many birthdays" and leaving
OL,21,Fhim visually impaired.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
