OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1794293817
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSASailing gives visually impaired
OL,4,Achild 'another sense of life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it has not diminished his
OL,7,Fpositivity, and since he was eight,
OL,8,Fwith the help of the BBC's Children in
OL,9,FNeed, he has attended specialist
OL,10,Fsailing lessons with the Ellen
OL,11,FMacArthur Cancer Trust, giving him
OL,12,F"another sense of life", he says.
